BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Buncombe County Government
SUMMARY:Senior Dining and Wellness/Grove Street Community Center
LOCATION:Grove Street Community Center<br>36 Grove Street
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260804T114500
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260804T123000
X-MICROSOFT-CDO-ALLDAYEVENT:FALSE
URL:https://www.ashevillenc.gov/department/parks-recreation/
X-TRUMBA-CUSTOMFIELD;NAME="Event Type";ID=21;TYPE=number:Default Templat
 e
X-TRUMBA-CUSTOMFIELD;NAME="Notice - Description";ID=51963;TYPE=SingleLin
 e:Senior Dining and Wellness
DTSTAMP:20240804T084841Z
DESCRIPTION:Notice - Description: Senior Dining and Wellness<br>Link: ht
 tps://www.ashevillenc.gov/department/parks-recreation/<br><br>The Counci
 l on Aging Senior Dining and Wellness Program offers eligible adults the
  opportunity to enjoy daily nutritious\, hot lunches from Moose Cafe alo
 ng with weekly fresh local produce in a fun\, safe\, and social setting.
 &#160\; More than a meal\, this program connects participants to health 
 and wellness programming\, opportunities for socialization\, as well as 
 community resources.&#160\; Call 828-277-8288 to register.&#160\;<br><br
 >The Senior Dining and Wellness Program is a program funded through gran
 ts received by Council on Aging of Buncombe County.&#160\; While there i
 s no charge to participate\, individuals are given the opportunity to ex
 pand services through consumer contributions.&#160\;&#160\;
CATEGORIES:Age Friendly
UID:http://uid.trumba.com/event/176642903
X-TRUMBA-LINK:https://www.buncombecounty.org/countycenter/events-calenda
 r.aspx?trumbaEmbed=view%3Devent%26eventid%3D176642903
END:VEVENT
