DESCRIPTION:<br><strong>The BCHHS Mobile Team will offer the following s
 ervices</strong>&#160\;(all free\, regardless of insurance status\, unle
 ss otherwise noted):<ul> <li><strong>Immunization/Vaccine Reviews and Re
 cord Printouts</strong>	</li><li><strong>Free Immunizations</strong>:<em
 >&#160\;Insurance accepted but not required</em>	<ul> <li>COVID (ages 12
 +)		</li><li>Tdap (Tetanus\, Diphtheria\, Pertussis)		</li><li>Hepatitis
  A		</li><li>Hepatitis B		</li><li>Mpox		</li><li>Shingles (age 50+): <e
 m>Requires insurance or Patient Assistance (application available)</em>	
 </li></ul>		</li><li><strong>Harm Reduction Services &amp\; Resources</s
 trong>	</li><li><strong>Rapid Testing</strong>&#160\;(HIV\, Hepatitis C
 \, Syphilis)	</li><li><strong>STI Testing</strong>&#160\;(Chlamydia\, Gon
 orrhea\, Hepatitis B)	</li><li><strong>Peer Support Services</strong>	</
 li><li><strong>Connections to Local Health and Social Service Resources<
 /strong>	</li><li><strong>Health Education</strong></li></ul><strong>**S
 ervicios disponibles en espa&#241\;ol**</strong>
CATEGORIES:Mobile Team
