DESCRIPTION:Link: https://haywoodstreet.org<br><br>Come see the Mobile T
 eam at Haywood Street Congregation! The Downtown Welcome Table lunch is 
 open to everyone\, 10 am - 12 pm.<br><br><strong>The BCHHS Mobile Team w
 ill offer the following services</strong>&#160\;(all free\, regardless o
 f insurance status\, unless otherwise noted):<ul> <li><strong>Immunizati
 on/Vaccine Reviews and Record Printouts</strong>	</li><li><strong>Free I
 mmunizations</strong>:&#160\;<em>Insurance accepted but not required</em
 >	<ul> <li>Influenza/Flu (age 6+ months)		</li><li>COVID (ages 12+)		</l
 i><li>Tdap (Tetanus\, Diphtheria\, Pertussis)		</li><li>Hepatitis A		</l
 i><li>Hepatitis B		</li><li>Mpox		</li><li>Shingles (age 50+):&#160\;<em
 >Requires insurance or Patient Assistance approval (application availabl
 e)</em>	</li></ul>		</li><li><strong>Rapid Testing</strong> (HIV\, Hepat
 itis C\, Syphilis)	</li><li><strong>STI Testing&#160\;</strong>(Chlamydi
