X-SOURCE:Buncombe County Government
SUMMARY:Health Education Leading to Prevention (HELP) Program
LOCATION:Linwood Crump Shiloh Community Center\, 121 Shiloh Road\, Ashev
 ille
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260923T120000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260923T130000
X-MICROSOFT-CDO-ALLDAYEVENT:FALSE
X-TRUMBA-CUSTOMFIELD;NAME="Event Type";ID=21;TYPE=number:Default Templat
 e
DTSTAMP:20221128T170914Z
DESCRIPTION:<br>Health Education Leading to Prevention (HELP) Program - 
 The third and fourth Wednesdays\, 12 pm - 1 pm. In partnership with Shil
 oh Community Association\, IFPHA\, and Avery Health Education &amp\; Con
 sulting LLC led by Kathey Avery\, these classes focus on the self-manage
 ment of chronic disease and diabetes as well as maintaining a healthy an
 d well-balanced lifestyle. No pre-registration required.
CATEGORIES:Age Friendly
